  "body": "• Light-filled single-level home with 4 bedrooms & 2 bathrooms\r\n• Two generous living areas – perfect for family living or home office\r\n• Private sun-drenched deck ideal for coffee, BBQs & relaxation\r\n• Fully fenced front & back yards – safe for kids and pets\r\n• Recently refreshed with new carpet, tiles & paint – move-in ready\r\n• Zoned for top schools: Wakaaranga Primary, Farm Cove Intermediate & Pakuranga College\r\n• Convenient to Half Moon Bay Ferry, shopping centres & parks\r\n• Motivated vendor -  Call us now!\r\n\r\nDiscover the perfect blend of comfort, privacy, and opportunity in this inviting 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom single-level home in Half Moon Bay. Bathed in natural light and recently refreshed with new carpet, tiled flooring, and interior paint, the home feels bright, welcoming, and ready for you to move in.\r\n\r\nDesigned with family life in mind, it offers two generous living areas, ideal for entertaining, relaxing, or creating separate spaces for work. One living area opens out to a sun-drenched deck, perfect for morning coffee, weekend BBQs, or simply soaking up the outdoors in complete privacy. The open-plan kitchen and dining area form a practical hub where daily life flows effortlessly.\r\n\r\nBoth the front and back yards provide secure and versatile outdoor spaces—perfect for children, pets, or simply enjoying the fresh air. Heater panels throughout ensure year-round comfort, while the double garage adds secure parking plus excellent space for storage, a workshop, or hobby projects.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to local amenities including Bus Stops, Half Moon Bay Ferry Terminals, Major Shopping Malls, local eateries and Lloyd Elsmore Park. Zoned for Wakaaranga Primary School, Farm Cove Intermediate and Pakuranga College. Recently refreshed yet still offering scope to modernise and personalise, it presents an exciting opportunity for buyers looking for value, space, and flexibility.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss your chance to secure a light-filled, private, and versatile home in Half Moon Bay—opportunities like this don’t come along often, and homes of this calibre move fast! Contact us today for more details or to arrange a private viewing.",
